 Y week since June 2025. Now that we achieved our Blue Wave\, we decided to
  continue to "sign wave" with positive ideas on how to repair our democrac
 y. The joy we receive from the many cars passing by with honks\, cheers an
 d waves made us realize we need to continue this effort. We do it for them
  as well as for us. This sense of joy and renewing our democracy is contag
 ious and should never waver. We also contribute $10/mo to our local fo
LOCATION:Main St. under the Clock\, Weaverville\, NC\, 28787
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/buncombedems/event/1080396/
