 ploads/event/Holiday%2Bparty_20261104184911184208.png
DESCRIPTION:Join us for our Annual Holiday Party on December 10th at 7:00p
 m! We will get to meet and celebrate many of our Buncombe County winners i
 n this year's BLUE WAVE election. You'll watch our slideshow of this year'
 s events and volunteer efforts\, enjoy hors d'oeuvres and sweets\, and by 
 popular demand we're bringing back our Wishes for America door prize game.
  We now have the opportunity to REBUILD our democracy\, so share your visi
 on and win a prize! Space is limited\, so you must register to attend. W
LOCATION:Weaverville Community Center\, 60 Lakeshore Dr\, Weaverville\, NC
 \, 28787
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/buncombedems/event/1079757/
X-SOURCE:Buncombe County Democratic Party
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Precinct 4.1 and Northern Neighbors Social\, with some Political A
 ction thrown in!
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261214T143000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261214T160000
UID:307195e647fd882e7e82e0f462e32293@mobilize.us
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mobilize-uploads-prod.s3.amazonaws.com/u
 ploads/event/Dec%2014_20260917193707559702.png
DESCRIPTION:The last N. AVL Democratic Precinct 4.1 Social of 2026. Cash b
 ar for NA and higher octane drinks\; snacks available at the bar. We plan 
 to take stock of where we are in 2026 and where we want to go as a group i
 n 2027 - political\, social\, action events . . . . Who should attend: All
  Democratic Precinct 4.1 folks\, plus any who would like to attend from th
 e N. AVL Cluster or any other group of like-minded citizens to gather for 
 celebration\, company\, and comfort in shared beliefs.
LOCATION:Ginger's Revenge\, 829 Riverside Dr #100\, Asheville\, NC\, 28801
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/buncombedems/event/1038197/
X-SOURCE:Buncombe County Democratic Party
END:VEVENT
