BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:South Buncombe Drop-In Post Election Celebration!
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261118T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261118T170000
UID:7b458c35caf202262f122521f56294dd@mobilize.us
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mobilize-uploads-prod.s3.amazonaws.com/u
 ploads/event/South%20Buncombe%20Drop-In%20Victory%20Celebration_2026110918
 5404219996.png
DESCRIPTION:Hey\, South Buncombe Dems - it’s time to celebrate! We’re 
 gathering at the Flying Squirrel Pub in Arden to take a victory sip\, talk
  about the election\, thank everybody for their efforts and envision our b
 righter future together. That day also happens to be the Flying Squirrel
 ’s “Give Back Day” for Arden Elementary\, so as you buy food and dri
 nk\, you’ll be supporting a local school at the same time! Totally casua
 l\, totally fun\, a totally well-earned break! South Buncombe Precincts ar
 e 18.2\, 19.1\, 2
LOCATION:The Flying Squirrel Pub\, 3578 Sweeten Creek Rd\, Royal Pines\, N
 C\, 28704
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/buncombedems/event/1080609/
X-SOURCE:Buncombe County Democratic Party
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Black Mountain Democrats Read Book Club
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261120T070000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261120T080000
UID:0ad96ea4f6438e14451ef7f00aca73f9@mobilize.us
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mobilize-uploads-prod.s3.amazonaws.com/u
 ploads/event/book%20club_20261005105512912321.png
DESCRIPTION:Each month we discuss a book agreed upon at the previous meeti
 ng. The November pick is "The Rise and Fall of the Artificial State" by Ji
 ll Lepore. Inspired by Hannah Arendt's "The Origins of Totalitarianism\," 
 Lepore offers a critical examination of the modern technological revolutio
 n and how it has changed our social and political institutions. One review
  refers to the book as an inspiring wake-up call though a reviewer in The 
 Guardian finds Lepore's recommendations limited or too facile. Read i
LOCATION:Peri Social House\, 406 W State St\, Black Mountain\, NC\, 28711
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/buncombedems/event/1055361/
X-SOURCE:Buncombe County Democratic Party
END:VEVENT
